WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.800
[Gandalf’s staff illuminates the Hall of Durin as the Fellowship advances]

00:04.000 --> 00:06.200
[Drums in the deep; Goblins of Moria encircle the pillars as the Balrog roars afar]

00:06.400 --> 00:09.200
[Gandalf, Aragorn, Legolas, Gimli, Boromir, Frodo, Sam, Merry and Pippin run forward]

00:09.700 --> 00:11.800
Go back to the shadow!

00:12.000 --> 00:16.500
[Almost surrounded by the Goblin horde; the Balrog of Morgoth blazes afar in the background]

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000
[Gandalf’s staff blazes across the ancient flagstones]

00:19.100 --> 00:22.000
[Ringing steel and fiery whip in the pillared depths]

00:22.300 --> 00:24.400
You shall not pass!

00:25.000 --> 00:31.800
[The Balrog roars afar as the Fellowship races through Khazad-dûm]
